<title>HONG KONG: Solartech announces first final results.</title>
<headline>Solartech announces first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  22.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 12.84 gain</p>
<p>    Net			   94.44</p>
<p>    Operating revenue	 511.09</p>
<p>    Company name		Solartech International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 August 12-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  August 29</p>
<p>NOTE - Cable maker and exporter Solartech was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on December 12, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on subscription money received for the listing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
